        "kind": "behavior-change",
        "exposedClass": "review-required",
        "statement": "From Kafka 4.0.0, an environment that relied on the implicitly registered JMXReporter will no longer have it enabled unless metrics are enabled in .spec.kafka.metrics or JMXReporter is explicitly added to metric.reporters.",
